{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c06388c4263d7ab60e4fb0301a37e52b82d70e6cd4ea9d9645d6d2c31f2a46e2","ja":"愛の好奇心","zh":"爱的好奇心","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"41fed656e1232e2316910d1e0d19c5f8c32638f8d295f3225fa0beaf6842e929","ja":"いよいよ近づいてきたね。\n私達『chicAAmor』のお披露目ステージ。","zh":"终于要到了呢。\n我们『chicAAmor』的首次亮相舞台。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b93ce0cd84ad31cc6708c577be3f9b50f6e90bf03d222ff069b9e7b37a125065","ja":"はい！　私達のダンス、\nファンの皆さんにお見せするのが楽しみです！","zh":"好的！我很期待把我们的舞蹈展示给各位粉丝！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fe77ff9420e43d6440084975a824e81967016bdbd9ec699778459f2080e41d85","ja":"今回は、いつも以上に\n気合入れて練習したもんな。","zh":"这次可是比平时更加认真地练习了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f6cef03f19724909249b7906bb5e54813a2bd65e1228f8a1db785384ce58ca6d","ja":"うん。でも私、まだ満足してないよ。\n残った時間で、もっともっと磨きをかけないと！","zh":"嗯。不过我还不满足。要利用剩下的时间，继续精益求精才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"666d90a8628100a5ee04e13e24423dc8127cfbde93af43db17eb3fe9de17247c","ja":"私達の燃える情熱と愛……アモールを\nファンの皆さんに届けるために！！","zh":"为了把我们燃烧的热情与爱……阿莫尔，传递给各位粉丝！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e9661a8aad24ed56ccb3c156d170cfe271b4ec95eaebb9fb8977161a055cffe9","ja":"ふふっ。さすが紗代子ちゃんね。\nでも……愛、かあ。","zh":"呵呵，不愧是纱代子。\n不过……爱啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ee6c031d7945decbcc0bb681ec998a1ec916225546c1dd1dd3adadb23adc084e","ja":"私達のユニット名にも『Amor』って入ってるけど、\n口に出すと、やっぱりちょっと照れちゃうかも……。","zh":"我们的组合名里也有“Amor”，但要说出口的话，果然还是会有点害羞……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"3e4ba45b9db9e1c65c94a73c428ee762d063bb58ad10e68e567abd9142850a0c","ja":"そっ……そりゃ、しょうがないって。\nあたし達、まだ、その……若いんだからさ！","zh":"那……那也是没办法的事嘛。\n我们还……还年轻着呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"198e363b5b4b0ec33007f1cbe82277c411f58d5b2dfd15e9d230c72cc122266b","ja":"う、うん……そうだね。愛を語るには、\n私達、まだまだいろんな経験が足りないんだと思う。","zh":"嗯、嗯……是啊。要谈论爱的话，我觉得我们还缺少各种各样的经历。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"469144f75854a275faa5b40d2f124a82ce6c26193f815a951c13a61c3b0ac155","ja":"あ、でも、千鶴さんは？　セレブな千鶴さんなら、\n普通とは違う経験をいろいろしてるんじゃないかな？","zh":"啊，不过，千鹤小姐呢？像千鹤小姐这样出身名门的人，应该有过各种与众不同的经历吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7e0e23bfb4bd4017a17339c58df358537cf5efd9222f6abb0b67cd9becb26c4d","ja":"確かに、セレブな女性って、\nロマンスがつきものって印象もあるけど……。","zh":"确实，说到名媛，总给人一种少不了浪漫的印象……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"90d12bc68f960878bc6fed109cc8714778f6341a36ad9a55772cba7080d68650","ja":"もし迷惑じゃなければ、私、聞いてみたいです！\n少しでも自分の世界を広げるために……。","zh":"如果不麻烦的话，我想听听看！\n为了哪怕稍微拓宽一下自己的世界……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6542bf4ca96a15e876b51ea581715f55034b1fb540037747561abeb3a19166da","ja":"私、ちょっと千鶴さんを探してきますね！","zh":"我去找一下千鹤小姐！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d909ebadd520c56f947a7690a67c2c347171fef033ac0a13590abccb0b27e83f","ja":"あら、みなさん、\nこんなところで何のお話をしていますの？","zh":"哎呀，大家，你们在这种地方聊什么呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_866.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"b27d4ff759dbe18507db07202e5e347d4a76d4de6014020c4b2928bbbc67c9a1","ja":"あっ、千鶴さん！！　いいところに！！","zh":"啊，千鹤！！来得正好！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
